  "Boss Puzzles": "首领谜题",
  "Ever since he disappeared in a Sudoku attack, you have had questions about your father's fate. Now that the mythical castle Sudokuvania has reappeared, you know the answers must lie somewhere within.\n---\n\n[version 1.1.1]\nRules:\nComplete the Quests by filling each grid according to its rules. Completely filling all grids is NOT required to reach an ending of the story.\nSudoku - Unless overridden by an uncovered rule, you may assume that each grid follows normal sudoku rules: Place digits from 1-n into each grid, where n is the grid's square size, without repeating in a row, column, or box.\nDynamic Fog - Entering a correct digit into a cell will clear the fog from that cell and perhaps others.\nDynamic Rules - Additional rules will be displayed in this panel when certain cells are selected. Abridged rules are also displayed on the map itself. These rules are only valid if the selected cell is NOT covered by fog. Some cells outside the grid are uncovered by default because they have no associated rules; drag at these 'pan handles' to avoid spoilers.\nSelect the ⚙️ to read about settings.\nSelect the 📋 to read about play controls.\n\n[Click here](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/lineage-of-logic-plain?setting-nogrid=1&setting-largepuzzle=1) to play the plain version of this puzzle.": "自从父亲在一次数独袭击中失踪，你便一直想弄清他的遭遇。如今，传说中的数独魔城再度现世。你知道，答案一定就在城堡深处。\n---\n\n[版本 1.1.1]\n规则：\n按照每张网格各自的规则填数、完成任务，即可推动剧情。想看到故事结局，不必填满所有网格。\n数独——除非已解锁的特殊规则另有规定，否则每张网格都遵循普通数独规则：网格边长为 n，就在其中填入 1 至 n；同一行、列或宫内的数字不能重复。\n动态迷雾——在某个格子填入正确数字后，该格及附近其他格子的迷雾可能消散。\n动态规则——选中特定格子时，此面板会显示额外规则；地图上也有简写说明。只有当被选中的格子已不被迷雾遮挡，这些规则才有效。某些网格外的格子因没有关联规则而默认可见；可从这些「移动把手」开始拖动地图，以免提前看到剧情。\n选择 ⚙️ 可查看设置说明。\n选择 📋 可查看操作说明。\n\n[点此](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/lineage-of-logic-plain?setting-nogrid=1&setting-largepuzzle=1) 游玩不带装饰的简化版谜题。",
  "Ever since he disappeared in a Sudoku attack, you have had questions about your father's fate. Now that the mythical castle Sudokuvania has reappeared, you know the answers must lie somewhere within.": "自从父亲在一次数独袭击中失踪，你便一直想弄清他的遭遇。如今，传说中的数独魔城再度现世。你知道，答案一定就在城堡深处。",
