  "Sudoku - Unless overridden by an uncovered rule, you may assume that each grid follows normal sudoku rules: Place digits from 1-n into each grid, where n is the grid's square size, without repeating in a row, column, or box.": "数独——除非已解锁的特殊规则另有规定，否则每张网格都遵循普通数独规则：网格边长为 n，就在其中填入 1 至 n；同一行、列或宫内的数字不能重复。",
  "Dynamic Fog - Entering a correct digit into a cell will clear the fog from that cell and perhaps others.": "动态迷雾——在某个格子填入正确数字后，该格及附近其他格子的迷雾可能消散。",
  "Dynamic Rules - Additional rules will be displayed in this panel when certain cells are selected. Abridged rules are also displayed on the map itself. These rules are only valid if the selected cell is NOT covered by fog. Some cells outside the grid are uncovered by default because they have no associated rules; drag at these 'pan handles' to avoid spoilers.": "动态规则——选中特定格子时，此面板会显示额外规则；地图上也有简写说明。只有当被选中的格子已不被迷雾遮挡，这些规则才有效。某些网格外的格子因没有关联规则而默认可见；可从这些「移动把手」开始拖动地图，以免提前看到剧情。",
  "Select the ⚙️ to read about settings.": "选择 ⚙️ 可查看设置说明。",
