  "[Click here](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/lineage-of-logic-plain?setting-nogrid=1&setting-largepuzzle=1) to play the plain version of this puzzle.": "[点此](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/lineage-of-logic-plain?setting-nogrid=1&setting-largepuzzle=1) 游玩不带装饰的简化版谜题。",
  "Click here": "点此",
  "Is it an unfortunate coincidence that Sudokuvania appeared right on the border of this sleepy village, or was it part of some sinister plot?\\n\\nSudoku - Place a digit from 1-9 into each cell without digits repeating in a row, column, or 3x3 box.": "数独魔城偏偏出现在这座宁静小村的边界上。究竟只是巧合，还是某个阴谋的一环？\n\n数独——每格填入 1 至 9；同一行、列和 3×3 宫内的数字不能重复。",
  "Is it an unfortunate coincidence that Sudokuvania appeared right on the border of this sleepy village, or was it part of some sinister plot?": "数独魔城偏偏出现在这座宁静小村的边界上。究竟只是巧合，还是某个阴谋的一环？",
  "Sudoku - Place a digit from 1-9 into each cell without digits repeating in a row, column, or 3x3 box.": "数独——每格填入 1 至 9；同一行、列和 3×3 宫内的数字不能重复。",
  "The castle had appeared abandoned as you entered, until the portcullis crashed shut behind you. The only way out is through.\\n\\nSudoku - Place a digit from 1-6 into each cell without digits repeating in a row, column, or 3x2 box.\\n\\n[Click here to play the tutorial/prologue](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/prologue-empty-house?setting-nogrid=1).": "你进城时还以为这里空无一人，直到身后的铁闸轰然落下。如今，唯一的出路就在前方。\n\n数独——每格填入 1 至 6；同一行、列和 3×2 宫内的数字不能重复。\n\n[点此进入教程／序章](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/prologue-empty-house?setting-nogrid=1)。",
  "The castle had appeared abandoned as you entered, until the portcullis crashed shut behind you. The only way out is through.": "你进城时还以为这里空无一人，直到身后的铁闸轰然落下。如今，唯一的出路就在前方。",
  "Sudoku - Place a digit from 1-6 into each cell without digits repeating in a row, column, or 3x2 box.": "数独——每格填入 1 至 6；同一行、列和 3×2 宫内的数字不能重复。",
  "[Click here to play the tutorial/prologue](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/prologue-empty-house?setting-nogrid=1).": "[点此进入教程／序章](https://sudokupad.app/sudokuvania/prologue-empty-house?setting-nogrid=1)。",
  "Click here to play the tutorial/prologue": "点此进入教程／序章",
  "The corridors of Sudokuvania are lavish, but too worn down for a place that hasn't been seen for a hundred years. You see no one despite hearing movement in the distance.\\n\\nSudoku - Place a digit from 1-9 into each cell without digits repeating in a row, column, or 3x3 box.": "数独魔城的走廊装潢华丽，却又破旧得不像一座百年未现的城堡。你听见远处传来动静，却始终不见人影。\n\n数独——每格填入 1 至 9；同一行、列和 3×3 宫内的数字不能重复。",
  "The corridors of Sudokuvania are lavish, but too worn down for a place that hasn't been seen for a hundred years. You see no one despite hearing movement in the distance.": "数独魔城的走廊装潢华丽，却又破旧得不像一座百年未现的城堡。你听见远处传来动静，却始终不见人影。",
  "Quest Lines indicate your primary goals in the game and can lead you towards your objectives. Each Quest Line follows its own unique rules; which are learned when the quest is given (though you may see the line before then). The line's rules are displayed in shorthand on the Journal, and in full in the Rules Panel when those Journal cells are selected.\\n\\nFor each Quest, there is exactly one associated line, which can move orthogonally or diagonally, but which cannot branch or cross itself.\\nQuest lines must remain inside the grids of the map.": "任务线指引游戏中的主要目标，并将你引向任务目的地。每条任务线都有独特规则，接受任务时才会学到；有时你会先看到线条。任务日志中会显示规则简述，选中日志对应格子后，完整说明会出现在规则面板。\n\n每项任务恰好对应一条任务线。任务线可以水平、垂直或斜向延伸，但不能分叉，也不能与自身交叉。\n任务线必须始终位于地图网格之内。",
  "Quest Lines indicate your primary goals in the game and can lead you towards your objectives. Each Quest Line follows its own unique rules; which are learned when the quest is given (though you may see the line before then). The line's rules are displayed in shorthand on the Journal, and in full in the Rules Panel when those Journal cells are selected.": "任务线指引游戏中的主要目标，并将你引向任务目的地。每条任务线都有独特规则，接受任务时才会学到；有时你会先看到线条。任务日志中会显示规则简述，选中日志对应格子后，完整说明会出现在规则面板。",
  "For each Quest, there is exactly one associated line, which can move orthogonally or diagonally, but which cannot branch or cross itself.": "每项任务恰好对应一条任务线。任务线可以水平、垂直或斜向延伸，但不能分叉，也不能与自身交叉。",
  "Quest lines must remain inside the grids of the map.": "任务线必须始终位于地图网格之内。"
}
